{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Middle of \u201cNowhere\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve arrived where the maps end and the wild, untamed frontier begins. Your mission is to build a thriving town from the ground up \u2014 a place that will attract settlers, traders, and fortune\u2011seekers. This land may look worthless\u2026 but give it time. Beneath the surface lie riches that could change your life forever.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/e7d568f849f07b5e5f9d72b4252a6b93.poster.avif?t=1771425876\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/e7d568f849f07b5e5f9d72b4252a6b93.webm?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/e7d568f849f07b5e5f9d72b4252a6b93.mp4?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig, Mine, Prosper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore deeper layers of the earth and gather the resources that will become the foundation of your growing empire:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >coal, iron, copper, gold, and diamonds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crude oil hidden in deep underground deposits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >metal smelting furnaces and oil extraction machines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource brings you closer to a bigger town and greater opportunities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/d32dae6012474fe1fc1ffb19905eca89.poster.avif?t=1771425876\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/d32dae6012474fe1fc1ffb19905eca89.webm?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/d32dae6012474fe1fc1ffb19905eca89.mp4?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build the Town of Your Dreams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a few planks and a tent, but soon you\u2019ll be able to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >construct houses and attract new residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >expand your infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decorate and customize your own living space however you like</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlement can become a true oasis in the middle of the wasteland.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/042ac3df275f6ea30b86c047f9fd1d7c.poster.avif?t=1771425876\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/042ac3df275f6ea30b86c047f9fd1d7c.webm?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/042ac3df275f6ea30b86c047f9fd1d7c.mp4?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Gear and Optimize Your Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress requires investment. Buy better tools and explosives from traveling merchants. Improve your logistics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crates and wheelbarrows for transporting materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >horses and wagons for hauling large loads</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers so your town keeps growing even when you\u2019re busy elsewhere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/64a610acd3a50e962588786075bc1cde.poster.avif?t=1771425876\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/64a610acd3a50e962588786075bc1cde.webm?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/64a610acd3a50e962588786075bc1cde.mp4?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re Not Alone Out Here</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wild West isn\u2019t just gold and oil \u2014 it\u2019s danger too:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attacks from wild animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bandits roaming the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pistols and shotguns available for purchase to defend yourself and your townsfolk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlement must be safe if it\u2019s going to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/c05c2abe65ec3bb3326f55ab85af50c3.poster.avif?t=1771425876\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/c05c2abe65ec3bb3326f55ab85af50c3.webm?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/c05c2abe65ec3bb3326f55ab85af50c3.mp4?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Moment of Rest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of hard work, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >visit the saloon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play darts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shoot to the bottle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a sheriff needs a break.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/21808eb1624d99626898c41186adce79.poster.avif?t=1771425876\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/21808eb1624d99626898c41186adce79.webm?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/21808eb1624d99626898c41186adce79.mp4?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Dusty Outpost to Bustling Metropolis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to transform this forgotten \u201cNowhere\u201d into a thriving metropolis and rise from a small\u2011town sheriff to a wealthy governor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/bf36ce59aca9a65586f17c43a0f7bfb7.poster.avif?t=1771425876\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/bf36ce59aca9a65586f17c43a0f7bfb7.webm?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/extras/bf36ce59aca9a65586f17c43a0f7bfb7.mp4?t=1771425876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967130?t=1771425876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967130/eb871b76735da27844f6d7589e836828955b1618/page_bg_